## Page-Level Liquiflow Patterns
 
### Required on every page body
```
li-page       = [template name]   e.g. index, product, cart, collection
li-layout     = theme
```
 
### Required on the main wrapper
```
li-content-for-layout = (empty value)
```
 
### Section pattern
```
li-section              = [Section Name]
li-section:on_templates = [template name]   (restricts section to specific template)
```
 
---
 
## Home Page (`li-page="index"`)
 
### Sections
| Section Name (`li-section`) | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `Promoted` | Collection cards gated by `collection.metafields.collection.promoted` |
| `Hooper` | Tabbed sliders — Gift Guides + Find Your Store (metaobject-driven) |
| `Inspiration` | Services and Occasions feature items (linklist-driven) |
| `Team` | About/team section with static content |
 
### Key Liquiflow Patterns
 
**Promoted section — filtering by metafield:**
```
li-for  = collection in collections
li-if   = collection.metafields.collection.promoted
```
> Namespace is `collection`, key is `promoted` — note this is a collection metafield, not `custom`.
 
**Hooper section — metaobject sliders:**
```
li-for = guide in shop.metaobjects.gift_guide.values
li-for = store in shop.metaobjects.store_portal.values
```
Metaobject fields accessed as:
- `guide.name` / `store.name` — display name (custom field on metaobject)
- `guide.featured_image | image_url: width: 400`
- `guide.featured_image.alt | default: guide.name`
- `guide.system.url` — storefront URL for metaobject entry
**Inspiration section — linklist-driven:**
```
li-for = link in linklists['services'].links
li-for = link in linklists['occasions'].links
```
- `link.object.title` — the linked resource's title
- `link.object.description` — the linked collection's description (**only valid if linklist links point to collections**)
- `li-block="Services CTA"` / `li-block="Occasions CTA"` — unique block names per section
**Team section — static URLs:**
```
li-object:href = pages['about-us'].url     ← bracket notation required for hyphenated handles
li-object:href = routes.contact_url
```
 
### Fixes Applied
| Fix | Detail |
|---|---|
| Duplicate `li-block` names | `li-block="Button"` appeared twice in `li-section="Inspiration"`. Renamed to `"Services CTA"` and `"Occasions CTA"` |
| Missing `li-layout` | Added `li-layout="theme"` to body element |
 
