## Product Page (`li-page="product"`)
 
### Sections
| Section | Attribute |
|---|---|
| Product Hero | `li-section="Product Hero"` + `li-section:on_templates="product"` |
| Recommended Products | `li-section="Recommended Products"` + `li-section:on_templates="product"` |
 
### Key Liquiflow Patterns
 
**Theme blocks container:**
```
li-content-for-theme-blocks = (empty value)
```
Applied to `product-hero_info` div — creates block file container for the section.
 
**Media gallery (Swiper):**
```
li-for:inside = media in product.media
```
> `:inside` modifier renders the loop inside the element rather than wrapping it.
```
li-if = media.media_type == 'image'
li-if = media.media_type == 'video'
li-object:src = media | image_url: width: 1000, height: 1000
li-object = media | video_tag: controls: true
```
 
**Product form:**
```
li-form       = product
li-form:product = (empty value)   ← empty = use current page's product context
```
Converts to `{% form 'product', product %}` in Liquid.
 
**Price display:**
```
li-object = product.price | money
li-if     = product.compare_at_price > product.price
li-object = product.compare_at_price | money
```
 
**Availability:**
```
li-if     = product.available      ← in-stock row
li-unless = product.available      ← out-of-stock row
```
 
**Description:**
```
li-if     = product.description
li-object = product.description
```
 
**FAQ Accordion blocks:**
```
li-block          = Accordion
li-settings:text  = Heading
li-settings:richtext = Content
```
> `li-settings:richtext` creates a formatted rich text field in the Theme Editor.
 
**Recommended products (Section Rendering API — Alpha):**
```
li-render-recommended              = wrapper
li-render-recommended-product      = {{ product.id }}
li-render-recommended-path         = {{ routes.product_recommendations_url }}
li-render-recommended-intent       = complementary
li-render-recommended-limit        = 8
li-render-recommended              = target
li-for                             = product in recommendations.products
```
> Requires `section-rendering.js` in Shopify theme assets — already installed via head code.
 
### Fixes Applied
| Fix | Detail |
|---|---|
| Invalid `id` on accordion heading | Removed `id="accordion-heading-{{forloop.index}}"` — `forloop` is undefined outside a `li-for` loop |
| `li-block` on Add to Cart | Removed `li-block="Add to Cart"` from form group — Add to Cart should always be visible, not togglable |
 
